          "text": "{\"items\":[{\"id\":\"E01.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"environment-log\"],\"reason\":\"固定命令 `npm run dev -- --host 0.0.0.0 --port 3000` 返回状态 200；首屏截图显示完整 Flowboard 画布及三节点两箭头，而非加载占位。\"},{\"id\":\"E02.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"environment-log\",\"state-initial\",\"state-S07-reload\"],\"reason\":\"环境日志记录浏览器只允许候选 localhost、外部请求均被阻断，且 browser_log 为空；首屏和刷新后仍显示完整编辑界面及图形资源。\"},{\"id\":\"E03.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"environment-log\",\"state-SUP-final\"],\"reason\":\"演示链场景记录无浏览器错误；最终恢复快照后的画布仍可用并显示两套图及反馈提示。\"},{\"id\":\"E04.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-initial\",\"state-S06-reset-confirm\"],\"reason\":\"初始画布显示三节点两箭头；Reset 确认后画布回到相同三节点两箭头布局，出现 Board reset 提示。\"},{\"id\":\"C01.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S01-move\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"选择并拖动 Review 后，该节点移动至目标位置；Proposal 与 Release 保持原位。\"},{\"id\":\"C01.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-SUP-opposite-move\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"反向拖动 Release 后仅 Release 移动，Review 与 Proposal 未随之移动；选择框落在 Release 上。\"},{\"id\":\"C02.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S01-resize\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"拖动右下角后 Review 宽高均改变，文字仍包含在节点内，选择框随新边界更新。\"},{\"id\":\"C02.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-SUP-shrink\",\"state-SUP-shrink-hit\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"缩小后 Review 的选择框同步变小且文字仍在节点内；随后点击缩小后的节点并拖动成功，显示命中区域随尺寸更新。\"},{\"id\":\"C03.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S01-label\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"双击编辑后节点显示两行 Legal review / 48h SLA，画面中没有额外浮动文字副本。\"},{\"id\":\"C03.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-SUP-label-variant\",\"state-SUP-label2\",\"state-SUP-label2-move\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"参数复测标签为两行 Risk review / 12h SLA；提交后文本仍在节点内，拖动节点时文字随之移动。\"},{\"id\":\"C04.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S01-style\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"选中 Review 后将其背景改为粉色；Proposal 和 Release 保留原填充色。\"},{\"id\":\"C04.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-SUP-color-variant\",\"state-SUP-property-switch\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"选中 Review 后填充变绿；改选 Proposal 后选择框落在 Proposal 上，属性面板当前颜色显示为其蓝色，而非前一节点的绿色。\"},{\"id\":\"C05.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S02-marquee-group\"],\"reason\":\"框选包含三节点和两条箭头，独立标题位于框选区域外且未被选中。\"},{\"id\":\"C05.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S02-copy-finished\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"框选后点击空白取消选择；画布对象内容仍保留。截图中的副本是该操作链中先前复制的结果，不是取消选择导致的内容变化。\"},{\"id\":\"C06.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S03-panel-front\",\"state-S03-panel-back\"],\"reason\":\"R 工具拖出具有明显边界的大矩形；矩形可被选中，属性面板可见，并已设置为蓝色背景。\"},{\"id\":\"C06.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S03-panel-front\",\"state-S03-panel-back\",\"state-S04-move\"],\"reason\":\"置底后矩形内前景节点仍可见；随后 Security review 可单独选中、拖动，背景矩形保持原位。\"},{\"id\":\"C07.1\",\"verdict\":\"unjudgeable\",\"score\":null,\"evidence\":[\"state-SUP-dialog-isolation\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"日志记录了在导入对话框内输入临时内容并按 Ctrl+A，但所给对话框截图中的文本区为空，未显示文字选择状态；不足以确认 Ctrl+A 只选择输入文字。\"},{\"id\":\"C07.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-SUP-dialog-isolation\",\"state-SUP-dialog-cancel\",\"state-SUP-edit-after-dialog\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"对话框打开期间按 Delete 后，画布对象仍存在；取消对话框后可继续拖动 Proposal，证明输入操作未删除画布对象且后续编辑可继续。\"},{\"id\":\"G01.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S01-move\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"移动中间节点后，入边终点仍落在 Review 边界，出边起点仍落在 Release 边界；连线关系保持。\"},{\"id\":\"G01.2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S01-resize\",\"state-SUP-shrink\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\":\"节点改变宽高及缩小后，两条线端点均随节点边界更新，没有停留在旧坐标或标签中心。\"},{\"id\":\"G02.1\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"score\":1,\"evidence\":[\"state-S02-marquee-group\",\"state-S02-group-move\",\"operation-log\"],\"reason\